            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#38BDF8] mb-3">THE SHORT VERSION</p>
            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">A 4-inch block brush on a pole for oil, a 4-inch polyester brush for water-based, and a pad for speed.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Add a 3-inch brush with the right bristle for the railings. That four-tool kit, or less, covers almost every residential deck.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Picks -->
        <div id="top-picks" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            2. The 5 Best Deck Stain Brushes and Pads, Ranked
          </h2>

          <p>
